# Database dumps taken during a Postgres upgrade (see docs/upgrading-postgres.md) — they hold every
# row, refresh tokens included. Narrow on purpose: Prisma's migration .sql files are committed.
/url-shortener-backup*.sql

# Postman environment holds real values (tokens/passwords); the example is committed instead
postman/*.postman_environment.json
!postman/*.postman_environment.example.json
